drop (0.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Passphrases per link (scrypt; five wrong attempts lock the link).
  * Retry window: after a download the same IP may retry for 15 minutes.
  * End-to-end encrypted files: key and name in the URL fragment, decrypted
    in the browser (static/drop.js); SHA-256 verified after decryption.
  * One-time upload links (drop request) with size limit and inbox.
  * drop gc and a daily timer; status and event feed for the client.
  * nginx: redacted access logs (no full tokens), rate limit, upload
    location, Cloudflare Authenticated Origin Pulls (drop-aop).
  * drop-share: the laptop client (share) with notifications and bar output.
  * Packaged, with an end-to-end test suite run at build time.

 -- 0x64616e6e <daniel@este.systems>  Wed, 30 Sep 2026 18:00:00 +0400

